---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="Catalogue Auditor" current="auditor"><header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Review, then correct</div><h1>Catalogue Auditor</h1><p>Find data gaps and inconsistencies in your private catalogue. Every check is explained.</p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="/catalogue/">Open catalogue</a></header><p id="audit-plan" class="workspace-plan"></p><p id="audit-status" class="workspace-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Run a quality review</h2><p>A report is a snapshot of your whole private catalogue, up to 10,000 products and 12 MB of checked data. Choose a collection for a narrower report. Each product uses one audit-row credit. Reports never delete, overwrite or repair records automatically.</p><label class="workspace-field">Collection (blank for whole catalogue)<input id="audit-collection" maxlength="100" /></label><button id="audit-run" type="button" class="button button-signal" disabled>Review my catalogue</button><div id="audit-summary" hidden><h3 id="audit-score"></h3><p id="audit-formula"></p><p id="audit-time"></p><button id="audit-json" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Download full JSON report</button><button id="audit-csv" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Download issue CSV</button></div></section><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Transparent validation rules</h2><dl id="audit-rules"><dt>Eight equally weighted checks</dt><dd>Duplicate identifiers, duplicate SKUs, invalid GTINs, missing names, images or prices, inconsistent categories and invalid field formats.</dd></dl><p>A score of 100 means these checks found no issues; it does not certify product data accuracy, GS1 registration or regulatory compliance. A price of zero is accepted. Equivalent valid GTIN representations are compared together.</p></section><section id="audit-results" class="workspace-panel" hidden><h2>Flagged records</h2><label class="workspace-field">Filter rule<select id="audit-filter"><option value="">All issues</option></select></label><div class="workspace-table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Catalogue issues"><table class="workspace-table"><thead><tr><th>Product</th><th>Identifier</th><th>Findings</th><th>Review</th></tr></thead><tbody id="audit-rows"></tbody></table></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="audit-prev" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Previous</button><span id="audit-page"></span><button id="audit-next" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Next</button></div></section></AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/catalogue-auditor.ts"></script>
